# Customer Insight Intelligence - frontend environment example
#
# You usually do NOT need to set this manually:
#   - `npm run dev`   uses .env.development -> http://localhost:8000/api
#   - `npm run build` uses .env.production  -> /api  (same-origin deployment)
#
# Override here only if your backend runs somewhere else.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
